# Two seconds at real speed from the first frame: the pointer sweeps down the Transform card's
# four rows (y 402.5 to 595.5 at 1440 x 900). A video runs on the real clock in the browsers, so
# it is judged by eye, not compared frame by frame.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
video start hover-sweep
wait 300
move 200 380
move 200 620 over 1400
wait 300
video stop
